{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120537","id":3908146763,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7o8ZZL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120537","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120537.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120537.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120537","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120537/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120537/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120537/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/606624aeb34d263c3e04466b091892158864225d","number":120537,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `get_slot_count()`, `get_slot_input_port()`, and `get_slot_output_port()` to `GraphNode`.","user":{"login":"Zbyl","id":1767676,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Njc2NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1767676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl","html_url":"https://github.com/Zbyl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zbyl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- This PR adds `get_slot_count()`, `get_slot_input_port()` and `get_slot_output_port()` to `GraphNode`.\r\n- Those are symmetric to already existing `get_input_port_count()`, `get_input_port_slot()`, `get_output_port_count()` and `get_output_port_slot()`.\r\n- It closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8243\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- Original proposal suggested adding `get_input_slot_count()` and `get_output_slot_count()`, but slots are not input or output.  \r\n  There is only one kind of slot. Therefore just one `get_slot_count()` function was added.\r\n- In proposal discussion it was suggested that `get_child_count()` is sufficient, but it is not.  \r\n  Only `Control` derived children are counted as slots.\r\n- Naming of `get_slot_input_port()` and `get_slot_output_port()` is not as suggested in the proposal, but instead it is kept consistent with already existing functions `get_input_port_slot()` and `get_output_port_slot()`.\r\n- `slot_port_cache` is added in `GraphNode` instead of extending `slot_y_cache` because `slot_y_cache` is updated at a different time.  \r\n  `slot_port_cache` is updated together with `left_port_cache` and `right_port_cache`.\r\n- Code was tested manually and using provided unit tests.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"stat